@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Multi-column `groupby` in {func}`~scanpy.pl.dotplot`, {func}`~scanpy.pl.matrixplot`,
+{func}`~scanpy.pl.stacked_violin`, {func}`~scanpy.pl.tracksplot`, and
+{func}`~scanpy.pl.heatmap` now accepts integer-categorical and numeric
+observation columns instead of raising `TypeError`.
